%% NOVO (edição .NET) — Devolução e estorno (UC-004): RMA distinto do refund.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant ST as Next.js Storefront
    participant RET as Returns Service
    participant ADM as Control (aprovação four-eyes)
    participant PAY as Payments Service (owner)
    participant PSP as PSP (sandbox/fake)
    participant ORD as Orders Service
    participant EVT as Outbox/Kafka
    C->>ST: RequestReturn(order_id, reason)
    ST->>RET: RequestReturn
    RET->>RET: valida janela de política e estado Delivered
    RET-->>C: RMA criado (instruções logísticas)
    Note over RET,ADM: fluxo logístico reverso (transportadora) separado
    RET->>ADM: ApproveRefund request (risco financeiro)
    ADM->>ADM: requested_by != approved_by (INV-ADMIN-001)
    ADM-->>RET: aprovado (auditoria)
    RET->>PAY: Refund(capture_id, amount, idempotency_key)
    PAY->>PSP: Refund request
    alt PSP confirma
        PSP-->>PAY: Refunded (referência assinada)
        PAY->>EVT: Refunded event (outbox transacional)
        EVT->>ORD: projeção atualiza timeline do pedido
        ORD-->>C: status Refunded visível
    else PSP recusa/timeout
        PSP--xPAY: Unknown/Declined
        PAY->>PAY: RefundPending + reconciliação + incidente
    end
    Note over PAY,PSP: refund parcial suportado; nunca edit in place (INV-PAYMENT-001)
